API Docs
Base URL & Auth
Base URL
https://api.chatsorter.com
Auth Header
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_KEY
Endpoints
POST
/process
Store a message. Runs scoring, extraction, triggers background summarization.

{ "chat_id": "user_123", "message": "I prefer dark roast coffee" }
POST
/search
Retrieve relevant memories for a query. Call before each LLM response.

{ "chat_id": "user_123", "query": "food preferences?" }
POST
/sdk/v1
One-call store + retrieve. Default integration point for new projects.

{ "chat_id": "user_123", "message": "What coffee do I like?", "retrieve_memories": true }
Python Example
import requests

API = "https://api.chatsorter.com"
KEY = "your_key_here"
HDR = {"Authorization": f"Bearer {KEY}", "Content-Type": "application/json"}

# Store a message
requests.post(f"{API}/process", headers=HDR, json={
    "chat_id": "user_alice",
    "message": "I'm allergic to peanuts and I live in Austin"
})

# Retrieve context before LLM call
resp = requests.post(f"{API}/search", headers=HDR, json={
    "chat_id": "user_alice",
    "query": "food restrictions?"
})
memories = resp.json()["memories"]
# [{"summary": "User is allergic to peanuts", "score": 0.94}]
